    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Jungle Troll racial traits.</p><ul><li>+2 Agility, -2 Intellect, -2 Charisma; Medium; land speed 30 feet; low-light vision.</li><li>Rapid healing doubles hit points recovered from rest.</li><li>+1 attacks with thrown weapons; +2 Survival, Jump, and Tumble. These three skills are always class skills.</li><li>Automatic Common and Low Common; bonus Goblin, Orc, and Taur-ahe.</li><li>Favored class Barbarian; eligible for up to three jungle troll racial levels.</li></ul>"
    },
